{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0026","paragraphs":[{"id":"pc65befc8ca90-1","text":"留人不住。"},{"id":"pe4c62503019f-1","text":"醉解兰舟去。"},{"id":"p58930668bdc3-1","text":"一棹碧涛春水路。"},{"id":"padcd79d25d09-1","text":"过尽晓莺啼处。"},{"id":"p95dc707eced5-1","text":"渡头杨柳青青。"},{"id":"p695d55e12549-1","text":"枝枝叶叶离情。"},{"id":"pea44b5965939-1","text":"此後锦书休寄，画楼云雨无凭。"}]}